GET /v2/groups/{groupId}
Retrieve a group under your account
Required: groupId (path) — The group ID

DELETE /v2/groups/{groupId}
Delete a group under your account
Required: groupId (path) — The group ID

DELETE /v2/groups/{groupId}/members/{memberId}
Delete a member from a group under your account
Required: groupId (path) — The group ID; memberId (path) — The member ID

PATCH /v2/groups/{groupId}
Update a group under your account
Required: groupId (path) — The group ID; body (body)
